+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+The relevant comparison is the `SessionStart` hook on a 5,000-record store. The
+change moved `PRAGMA quick_check` off the read path; the trigger-maintained
+`meta.fts_rows` counter and the `CHECK (length(body) <= 2000)` constraint were
+added in the same change.
+
+| Version | `SessionStart` p50 |
+| --- | ---: |
+| Before that change (`quick_check` on the read path) | No measured p50 was found in this checkout. |
+| After that change (`quick_check` recorded on the write path) | No measured p50 was found in this checkout. |
+
+These values are deliberately left unreported rather than inferred from the
+source comment that records `quick_check` alone at 9.6 ms on a 5 MB database;
+that is not a measurement of the complete `SessionStart` hook on the specified
+5,000-record store.
